o  th e C o ntr o l and  J u r is­\ndiction  of the  V eterans ’ A dm inistr a­\ntio n\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me \nby section 1  of the act of March 3, 1925, \n43 Stat. 1212, it is hereby ordered as fol- * \nlows:\nThe following-described tract of land \ncomprising a portion of the Phoenix In­\ndian School Reserve at Phoenix, Arizona, \ntogether with all improvements thereon, \nis hereby transferred from the control \nand jurisdiction of the Department of \nthe Interior to the control and jurisdic­\ntion of the Veterans’ Administration:\nBeginning at a point at the northwest in­\ntersection of Indian School Road and 7th  \nStreet, the said point being within the Phoe­\nnix Indian School Reserve, Phoenix, Arizona;  \nthence north ","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_9855.txt","sha256":"013933da65e8cc3cefce8a748e57ee9a3d3a43fb58727111515d088033d51163","source":{"line":457,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"3ac6b2b8bd0d4db4e17fab9b9c23378dafdfed8df495371a0a902dc5722df2bb"}}]}
